    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/da81f3468fde2b9976543349eb188211.poster.avif?t=1728051763\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/da81f3468fde2b9976543349eb188211.webm?t=1728051763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/da81f3468fde2b9976543349eb188211.mp4?t=1728051763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Rune Gate has been breached. As the commander of the bridge guard, it's your duty to assemble a team of champions, each with unique specialties, to fend off the onslaught of enemies emerging from the gate. This is a deck-building roguelite that empowers you to customize your own cards by integrate various elemental runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/9ce8f549428d833d414f9823f8039b07.webp?t=1728051763\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/309193ec7641b29e1f5d961b241d8907.poster.avif?t=1728051763\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/309193ec7641b29e1f5d961b241d8907.webm?t=1728051763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/309193ec7641b29e1f5d961b241d8907.mp4?t=1728051763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Rune system makes card customization swift and effortless. You have the freedom to forge synergies between cards, determining their power and utility. Insert attack runes for high-damage cards; use draw or energy runes for utility cards; and debuff runes transform your cards into potent curses. Want more versatility? Simply upgrade your card to add a new rune slot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/19b849bfd73207b78c2b51cb9b2d5ee5.webp?t=1728051763\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/35421732d4d62641744a0dd3dec59ebf.poster.avif?t=1728051763\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/35421732d4d62641744a0dd3dec59ebf.webm?t=1728051763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/35421732d4d62641744a0dd3dec59ebf.mp4?t=1728051763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, the game features nearly 200 unique runes, each with its own signature abilities and constraints. Players can acquire runes by winning combats, crafting them from lower-tier runes, or obtaining them through encounters and merchant inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/7701fae4a39e0ae4921b1e18d5e8f998.webp?t=1728051763\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/0b90af2d084fc115eda4719d5f209e80.avif?t=1728051763\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you lead a party of champions against adversaries. Each champion wields a specific type of weapon and utilizes unique runes. Every weapon type corresponds to a distinct deck, offering a unique set of cards for strategic deck-building. With 18 champions available, featuring three from each elemental type, a rich variety of team compositions and strategies awaits your command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gears and Augments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only do you acquire runes following combat, but you can also obtain gear and augments. Gear enhances your champions' offensive and defensive capabilities and includes runes for further customization. Augments provide unique buffs to your champions during combat, offering additional strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Units to Summon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Followers represent another form of 'Gear' available in the game, capable of being summoned as allies during battles. They each possess a distinct set of cards that can be customized with runes, and can be a great help to your mid to late game strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meta Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fame is earned through combat across different realms, and it serves as a key resource. You can utilize this fame to permanently unlock specific runes, granting yourself a range of advantages that significantly aid in progressing through future runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Discord: </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/da81f3468fde2b9976543349eb188211.poster.avif?t=1728051763\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/da81f3468fde2b9976543349eb188211.webm?t=1728051763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/da81f3468fde2b9976543349eb188211.mp4?t=1728051763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Rune Gate has been breached. As the commander of the bridge guard, it's your duty to assemble a team of champions, each with unique specialties, to fend off the onslaught of enemies emerging from the gate. This is a deck-building roguelite that empowers you to customize your own cards by integrate various elemental runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/9ce8f549428d833d414f9823f8039b07.webp?t=1728051763\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/309193ec7641b29e1f5d961b241d8907.poster.avif?t=1728051763\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/309193ec7641b29e1f5d961b241d8907.webm?t=1728051763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/309193ec7641b29e1f5d961b241d8907.mp4?t=1728051763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Rune system makes card customization swift and effortless. You have the freedom to forge synergies between cards, determining their power and utility. Insert attack runes for high-damage cards; use draw or energy runes for utility cards; and debuff runes transform your cards into potent curses. Want more versatility? Simply upgrade your card to add a new rune slot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/19b849bfd73207b78c2b51cb9b2d5ee5.webp?t=1728051763\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/35421732d4d62641744a0dd3dec59ebf.poster.avif?t=1728051763\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/35421732d4d62641744a0dd3dec59ebf.webm?t=1728051763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/35421732d4d62641744a0dd3dec59ebf.mp4?t=1728051763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, the game features nearly 200 unique runes, each with its own signature abilities and constraints. Players can acquire runes by winning combats, crafting them from lower-tier runes, or obtaining them through encounters and merchant inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/7701fae4a39e0ae4921b1e18d5e8f998.webp?t=1728051763\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522270/extras/0b90af2d084fc115eda4719d5f209e80.avif?t=1728051763\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you lead a party of champions against adversaries. Each champion wields a specific type of weapon and utilizes unique runes. Every weapon type corresponds to a distinct deck, offering a unique set of cards for strategic deck-building. With 18 champions available, featuring three from each elemental type, a rich variety of team compositions and strategies awaits your command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gears and Augments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only do you acquire runes following combat, but you can also obtain gear and augments. Gear enhances your champions' offensive and defensive capabilities and includes runes for further customization. Augments provide unique buffs to your champions during combat, offering additional strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Units to Summon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Followers represent another form of 'Gear' available in the game, capable of being summoned as allies during battles. They each possess a distinct set of cards that can be customized with runes, and can be a great help to your mid to late game strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meta Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fame is earned through combat across different realms, and it serves as a key resource. You can utilize this fame to permanently unlock specific runes, granting yourself a range of advantages that significantly aid in progressing through future runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Discord: </p>",
    "short_description": "Rune Gate is a roguelite deckbuilder centered on card customization. Craft unique battle strategies with different runes. Face continuous challenges, where every choice can lead to victory or defeat. Dive into Rune Gate, unleash creativity, and explore endless card combinations.",
